-- Before this: 0 clamshells, 0 frog pumps, 0 curtsy lunges, 0 fire hydrants, 0 donkey kicks,
-- 0 Bulgarian split squats, 0 plain reverse lunges, and exactly ONE hip thrust, which was filed
