-- Cues were researched per movement (setup, execution, the one thing people get wrong, and safety
-- for a population including postpartum women and lower-back and knee history) and written in
-- Stephanie voice in both languages. Every row is is_core: they are new, unfilmed, and central, so
-- they belong on the shot list and the 0107 trigger protects them from any future curation pass.
